#: prefs.js:350
msgid "Applies to GTK3 apps: Firefox, GIMP, and most traditional apps that aren’t built with libadwaita. Set via the gtk-theme gsetting, which points GTK at ~/.themes/<name>/gtk-3.0/.\n"
"\n"
"Does NOT affect Files, Settings, Extensions, Tweaks, or other GTK4/libadwaita apps — see the libadwaita section below for those."
